    "topic": "DevFest · Analyst",
    "body": "Use neutral questions and separate observations from assumptions.\n\n1. “How is your team using Gemini or agent workflows today: exploration, pilots, or production? What helped or blocked the move?”\n\n2. “When local clients evaluate AWS, Azure and Google Cloud, what factors drive their choice? Have you personally seen migrations recently?”\n\n3. “Which Google Cloud setup or development tasks create the most friction for your team? What are you comparing them with?”\n\nCapture: role and organization (when shared), use case, stage, timeframe, firsthand versus secondhand evidence, pain point and follow-up question.\n\nDo not generalize from one conversation to an entire region or market.",
