    "title": "Duplicate Sentinel · MVP acceptance checklist",
    "topic": "Hackathon · Duplicate Sentinel",
    "body": "1. Working URL input: accept a webpage address and start a scan.\n2. Reliable extraction: handle relevant loading, pagination and page sections where accessible; report failures and coverage limits.\n3. Separate vendor/product detection: do not conflate vendors with their individual products.\n4. Explainable report: show match evidence, score meaning and uncertain cases for review.\n5. Accuracy testing: compare with manually verified examples; record precision, recall, missed duplicates and false positives.\n\nStart with one accessible webpage, then extend. Authentication, access restrictions and anti-bot controls can limit extraction; no agent can guarantee complete extraction from every site.\n\nSimilarity is not identity. Use evidence beyond names and descriptions before flagging likely duplicates.",
